": "I guess I just wish I could fill that quiet with something else, but it never quite feels right.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 96}, {"session_id": "p000174-calib_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "It's just... the quiet is hard to ignore, but I appreciate you understanding.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 77}, {"session_id": "p000174-calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "It's still hard to see Tank's spot empty.", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 74}, {"session_id": "p000174-calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "It's still hard to see Tank's spot empty. Sometimes I feel like I'm talking to the wall.", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 121}, {"session_id": "p000174-calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "Those walks really do make a difference. And thinking about him walking with me helps. I'll keep doing it.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 106}, {"session_id": "p000174-calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "But I do miss those walks. Maybe I'll start walking in the park and pretend it's him.", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 152}, {"session_id": "p000174-calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "But I do miss those walks.", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 93}, {"session_id": "p000174-calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "But there are days when it feels impossible.", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 102}, {"session_id": "p000174-calib_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Missing him a lot lately.", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 86}, {"session_id": "p000174-calib_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Tanks used to meet me at the door every day. It was like he knew just how hard the day was. Missing those moments.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 114}, {"session_id": "p000174-calib_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Tank was really part of the family. Missing him a lot lately.", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 86}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261002T174153Z", "last_u